        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lu'v'ango ku'nguno ya lu'doono",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ku'du' mwiv'ezezye ki'mbulimbuli ninga ki'mo, ninga ku'ki'ndi'ka isu'mbano lya ku'pu'nza, ninga nhi'ngi' ya iwe, ninga iwe li'mo lya koola mu nsi' yinywe ki'gele muki'ku'v'i'i'le ninga ki'mo. Ku'nguno ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yi'li'mudima muzidime nsiku' zya ki'suuho i'zyo zili' Sabato zyanne na ku'haku'zya hantu' hasondo ha wanne. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘U'lu' muzidime nhama zyanne ku' lu'doono na ku'londa milagi' zyanne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "haho ndayi'lete nvula yi'tonye ku' itungo lyayo, ki'gele nsi' yi'fumye viliwa vyayo, na miti' zya mu migu'nda zilapambe visumo vyazyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' ku'gu'manga mbutoo ku' winywe ku'lendeleye mpaka ha itungo lya kwi'mbu'la nzabibu, na kwi'mbu'la nzabibu ku'lendeleye mpaka ha itungo lya ku'v'i'v'a mbiyu', na inywe mulalye viliwa vinywe na kwiku'ta, na mulikale na ku'hola mu nsi' yinywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ndamupe ku'hola mu nsi', na mulav'e muli'lala bila ku'kangwa na ki'ntu'. Ndazisinie ndimu ndaki mu nsi' na nsi' yinywe yi'kasye yi'v'e na wu'lu'gu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulav'apeezye v'anisi v'inywe, na mulav'awu'lage ku' lu'panga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'antu' v'inywe v'atano v'alav'apeezye v'anisi igana, na v'antu' v'inywe igana v'alav'apeezye v'anisi vihu'mbi' iku'mi. V'anisi v'inywe v'alagwe ha mbele yinywe ku' lu'panga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ndamudoonoke na ku'muv'ezya muv'e na wu'v'yalwa wingi na kwingi'ha, nanne ndagelani'zye ilagano lyanne ku' winywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha itungo lya kwi'mbu'la mulav'e mukaali' muli'lya viliwa vya mwaka u'go gwav'i'tile, na yi'lamudime ku'visinia viliwa vilaala ki'gele mupandi'ke ha ku'tu'u'la viliwa vipya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndatu'u'le wikalo wanne mugati' na inywe, nanne nkasye mmuleke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanne ndayu'mbe hagati' yinywe na ku'v'a Mulungu winywe na inywe mulav'e v'antu' v'anne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe, u'yo namufumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili ki'gele muleke ku'v'a v'asese v'a V'amisili. Ene nayi'v'i'nzile segeya yinywe na ku'muv'ezya muyu'mbe musanukile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lu'duko ku'nguno ya ku'gayiwa lu'doono",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ali'vi u'lu' muleke ku'ndegeleka na ku'londa nhama zyanne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na inywe u'lu' muzikaane milagi' zyanne na ku'zigaya nzi'la zyanne, hangi' muleke ku'gelani'zya nhama zyanne na ku'li'v'i'nza ilagano lyanne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "haho ndamuv'ezezye igambo i'li': Ndalete wu'kange wu'hanya ha igu'lya yinywe, malwile mahanya, kakenke, homa ya ku'muhofuzya minso ginywe na ku'wu'sinia wu'zuwu'ku winywe hado hado. Mulav'i'v'i'le gele mbiyu' zinywe, ku'nguno v'anisi v'inywe v'alavilye viliwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ene ndamupe nkonya, na inywe mulagu'mwe na v'anisi v'inywe. Mulatemwe na av'o v'amugayile, na mulapeele ninga yi'v'e hadu'hu' muntu' u'yo amupeezizye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘U'lu' muv'e mukaali' du' ku'ndegeleka, haho ndamupe lu'duko hangi' kali' mupungati' ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi winywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndazivunagu'le mpaka zinywe na ku'v'ezya chelela i'cho ki'li' ha igu'lya yinywe ki'v'e ki'lambu ki'ti' chu'ma, na nsi' yi'lambe ki'ti' shaba ku'nguno yi'laleke ku'tonyelwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulatu'mi'le nguzu zinywe gele, ku'nguno migu'nda zinywe zikasye zifumye viliwa ninga miti' zya nsi' yinywe zilaleke ku'pamba visumo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘U'lu' mwendeleye ku'nyani'li'zya na ku'kaana ku'ndegeleka, ndamongezezye lu'duko kali' mupungati' ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi winywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndatu'me ndimu ndaki ku' winywe, zilamupuli'le v'ana v'inywe, zilazimangu'zye mitugo zinywe, na ku'dohya lu'v'alo lwa v'antu' v'inywe, ninga nzi'la zinywe zilav'e na ki'nyuli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ninga ku' lu'duko lwenu'lo, u'lu' muv'e mukaanile ku'ngalu'ki'la na mwendeleye ku'nyani'li'zya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hohene ndav'e na wanisi na inywe na ku'mupa lu'duko kali' mupungati' ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi winywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndalete wu'lu'gu' ku' winywe, ki'gele ku'li'pi'ki'zya, ku'nguno ya ku'li'v'i'nza ilagano lyanne. Aho mulav'e muli'peelela mu kaya zinywe, ndamuletele malwile madaki mugati' na inywe, na inywe mulatu'u'lwe mu makono ga v'anisi v'inywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho ndav'e namusini'zya ndecha ya viliwa, v'aki'ma iku'mi v'alakomele mugate mu liko li'mo du'. V'alamugawu'le ku' ki'pimo. Mulalye, ali'vi mukasye mwiku'te.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Aho galav'e gamupandi'ka gose genago ali'vi mukaane ku'ndegeleka na mwendeleye ku'nyani'li'zya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "haho ndatu'u'le wanisi na inywe ku' ki'sila channe, ene mweni'ki'li' ndamupe hangi' lu'duko kali' mupungati' ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi winywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulalye nyama ya miv'i'li' zya v'ana v'inywe, v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma, ku'nguno ya nzala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndahazimangu'zye ha lwandi' lwinywe lwa ku' igu'lya ku' ngu'lu' u'ko muli'zisengaga milungu zinywe. Ndabomolange mahozezyo ginywe ga ku'zuki'zi'zya wu'bani. Ndazitagi'le milambo zinywe ha igu'lya na vimbulimbuli vya milungu zinywe i'zyo zili' wu'du'hu' wu'zuwu'ku, nanne ndamugaye muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaziv'ezye kaya zinywe ziv'e mapagala, na ku'hav'ipya ha ki'la lwandi' lwinywe lu'sondo, ninga wu'motu wa kalu'mbi'lo kinywe nkasye nkazumye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanne ndayi'v'ipye nsi' yi'v'e na ki'nyuli, ki'gele ninga v'anisi vinywe av'o v'alasami'le mwenu'mo v'alakamalwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndamusambazye mugati' na makabi'la, nanne ndalete wu'lu'gu' wu'mulondezye. Nsi' yinywe yi'lav'e na ki'nyuli na kaya zinywe zilav'e mapagala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho nsi' yi'latogeziwe na visuuho vyazyo ha itungo i'lo yi'lav'e na ki'nyuli, na inywe aho mulav'e mugati' na nsi' ya v'anisi v'inywe. Nsi' yi'lasuuhe na kwihalali'la visuuho vyazyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itungo lyose i'lo nsi' yi'lav'e na ki'nyuli, yi'lasuuhe na kwihalali'la ki'suuho chayo i'cho yav'age yi'kav'ile ku'ki'pandi'ka ku' itungo aho mwav'age mwikalile mwenu'mo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Mugati' na inywe av'o v'alapu'lu'gu'ke, ndav'atu'u'li'le wov'a mu myoyo zyav'o, mugati' na nsi' zya v'anisi v'av'o, ninga muzwi gwa idu'tu' i'lo li'li'hehemulwa na muyaga li'lav'ezye v'apeele. V'alapeele ki'ti' v'apeelile wu'lu'gu', nav'o v'alagwe ninga i'vi ku'du'hu' u'yo av'apeezizye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'alav'e v'ali'gwa v'ali'wituli'nkania ki'ti' v'apeela wu'lu'gu' ninga i'vi ku'du'hu' u'yo av'apeezizye. Inywe mukasye muv'e na nguzu zya kwi'ma ha mbele ya v'anisi v'inywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulafwe mugati' na makabi'la, na nsi' zya v'anisi v'inywe zilamulye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Av'o v'alasigale v'alagande ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi wav'o, mugati' na nsi' zya v'anisi v'av'o. V'alagande ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi wav'o na wa v'agu'ku' v'av'o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ali'vi u'lu' v'azumye wu'kenagu'zi wav'o na wa v'agu'ku' v'av'o, ku'nguno ya wu'tale u'wo v'ambezezizye ene na i'vyo v'endeleyile ku'nyani'li'zya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hene nav'atu'u'li'lile wanisi na ku'v'afila ku' nsi' ya v'anisi v'av'o, yaani u'lu' myoyo zyav'o milambu mbe zitunie, nav'o v'azumye lu'duko lwa wu'kenagu'zi wav'o, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hohene ndalizu'ki'le ilagano lyanne na Abalahamu, Isaka na Yakobo na ku'yizu'ki'la nsi' i'yo nav'alagana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itungo i'lo v'alav'e ha ibala na nsi' yav'o, nayo yi'latogeziwe na ki'suuho, aho yi'lav'e yalekilwe na ki'nyuli, nav'o v'alalu'zumye lu'duko lwa wu'kenagu'zi wav'o, ku'nguno v'azikaanile milagi' zyanne na myoyo zyav'o zyazitalile nhama zyanne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi ninga haki'mo na genago gose, itungo i'lo v'alav'e mu nsi' ya v'anisi v'av'o, ene nkasye mbakaane, ninga ku'v'agaya mpaka ku'fiki'la ku'v'azimangu'zya na ku'li'v'i'nza ilagano lyanne ku' wav'o. Ku'nguno ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wav'o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi ku'nguno yav'o ndalizu'ki'le ilagano i'lo nalaganile na v'agu'ku' v'av'o, av'o nav'afumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili ha mbele ya minso ga makabi'la, ki'gele mbe Mulungu wav'o. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zyeni'zyo hu' nhama, milagi' na nzi'la i'zyo Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' waki'ndi'ka hagati' yakwe na V'aizilaeli u'ko ku' lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai ku'v'i'ti'la ku'mwa Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
